{"ancestors": "0,9018348,9018359", "bizKey": "9018365", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-09-05 16:04:22", "detail": "<p>题材基本面介绍：</p><p>光伏焊带是在电池片封装成组件的过程中，使用串焊机将焊带与电池片主栅线连接的重要光伏辅材，主要功能为连接光伏电池片及接线盒并传输电流。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/09/05/f902024e-b713-401b-851b-f8b91cec45ab-1693900920578.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 398.96px;height: 213.09px;\"/></p><p>光伏焊带由基材和表面涂层构成，基材主要是铜，起导电作用，表面涂层一般为锡合金，满足光伏焊带可焊性。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/09/05/03b760f8-0146-4732-9ec4-ec346dc17c03-1693900952490.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 377.99px;height: 357.52px;\"/></p><p>光伏焊带每块组件用量仅320g左右，耗量较少但整体成本占比达9.3%，占比相对较高</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/09/05/3464db65-329b-4580-a1dc-217e2de269f9-1693900999681.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 381.98px;height: 247.41px;\"/></p><p>2022年宇邦新材、同享科技、威腾电气在光伏焊带领域的市占率分别为17.2%、10.8%和4.7%</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/09/05/16d19efa-3666-4c5a-814a-6f656dd94e52-1693901060264.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p>", "firstLetter": "HD", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "焊带", "parentId": 9018359, "pctChg": -1.77, "reason": "焊带用于组件封装，起到导电作用。", "remark": "", "sort": -4, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9018365, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-09-05 16:23:23"}
